ioni, con il suo partito il PDP, ovvero il \"partito du pilu\", interamente i mezzi, che in questo caso vanno dal comizio in chiesa, all'offerta di ragazze seminude come fossero caramelle scartate, all'incarceramento del figlio Melo in sua vece. Fino alla più sporca delle truffe.","tagline":"I have no dream. Ma mi piace u pilu!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Whatsoeverly","overview":"Corrupt and sleazy entrepreneur Cetto La Qualunque comes back to Italy and \"jumps into politics\" lest his law-abiding opponent, Giovanni De Santis, is elected as mayor.","tagline":"I have no dream but I like beaver!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHj1sNJXyPtRZteG8GOkBftXnt1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gidMhSVYbDykTSsNAUMovdKCq1N.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":56339,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHj1sNJXyPtRZteG8GOkBftXnt1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aHj1sNJXyPtRZteG8GOkBftXnt1.jpg","language":"it","width":1460,"height":2191},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHj1sNJXyPtRZteG8GOkBftXnt1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aHj1sNJXyPtRZteG8GOkBftXnt1.jpg","language":"it","width":1460,"height":2191},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8J41rQCBrSzAZMNvUsZ3MqeXhQ6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8J41rQCBrSzAZMNvUsZ3MqeXhQ6.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lxnHvyfHp9PyPZe6gGBSmtDJFSu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lxnHvyfHp9PyPZe6gGBSmtDJFSu.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4afFcMHSQVTqoXon8kkKl8hgrg.jpg","previewUrl